Select Object.
The Station is a material flow object that supports an importer, for example the Source, the Drain, the
Station, the ParallelStation, the AssemblyStation, the DismantleStation, or the Conveyor.
To automatically enter the Station, drag the Workplace close to a side of the material flow object which
you want to use as the Station.
