At Entrance [check box]
To attach the Workplace to the entrance of the Conveyor, select this check box.
Conveyor Point-oriented object
Remarks
For the place-oriented material flow objects Plant Simulation selects At Entrance and At Exit by default.
Attach a Workplace to the Entrance of a Conveyor with Drag-and-Drop
• Select the Workplace with the mouse and drag it to the entrance of the Conveyor. The icon of the
Workplace shows a tooltip with Conveyor @ Entrance.
• Select the Conveyor, hold down Shift and drag it to the icon of the Workplace to attach it to its
entrance.
Attach a Workplace to a Place-oriented Material Flow Object with Drag-and-Drop
• Select the Workplace with the mouse and drag it to the object, the Station in the example below. The
icon of the Workplace shows a tooltip with Station @ Entrance & Exit.
• Select the Station and drag it to the icon of the Workplace to attach it to its entrance and exit.
Note
Assigning a new station to a Workplace via SimTalk does not change the current assignment to the
entrance or the exit.
