Capacity [text box] - Workplace
Type the Capacity of the Workplace into the text box. The Capacity is the maximum number of Workers
that can stay on this Workplace at any one time.
Remarks
The Capacity is important if several tasks can be accomplished on this Workplace or if these tasks come
together there.
Plant Simulation uses the coordinate of the Workplace to find the shortest route to it, meaning that the
Worker walks to this coordinate and then jumps to the animation point of the Workplace.
Plant Simulation shows the Workers on the Workplace distributed across an Animation Area.
Note
You can only change the Capacity if the Workplace is empty.
Note
You can define a Recovery Time for a Workplace that has a Capacity of 1. It starts once a Worker leaves
the Workplace.
