Worker Stays Here After Completing the Job
To make the Worker stay on the Workplace after he completes his job, select this check box.
Remarks
To make the Worker return to the WorkerPool or to the Home Location immediately after finishing his job,
clear the check box.
You have to clear the check box if you activate the setting Get Job Orders At Home Only in the
WorkerPool.
Note
A Worker, who is not automatically brokered, stays on the Workplace to which he was sent, no matter if
you activated Worker Stays Here After Completing the Job/WorkerStaysHere or not in the Workplace.
Note
If a Worker stays on a Workplace while another Worker has to work on it, and if the Capacity of the
Workplace is used up, Plant Simulation shoves the Worker aside who is not working. This Worker then
exits the Workplace and returns to the WorkerPool or to the Home Location if you configured one.
